{
  "name": "pretty-print",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "keybindings": {
    "mod+h": "focus-prev",
    "mod+l": "focus-next"
  },
  "layout": {
    "children": [
      {
        "size": "12%",
        "pane": {
          "type": "command",
          "border": false,
          "command": "figlet -f small 'pretty  print' 2>/dev/null | lolcat -f -p 3 2>/dev/null || figlet -f small 'pretty print'"
        }
      },
      {
        "size": "88%",
        "direction": "row",
        "children": [
          {
            "size": "42%",
            "children": [
              {
                "size": "51%",
                "pane": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "title": " unicode  ·  no ANSI needed",
                  "border": true,
                  "content": "Box drawing:\n  ┌───┬───┐   ╔═══╦═══╗   ╭───┬───╮\n  │   │   │   ║   ║   ║   │   │   │\n  ├───┼───┤   ╠═══╬═══╣   ├───┼───┤\n  └───┴───┘   ╚═══╩═══╝   ╰───┴───╯\n\nBlocks / shading:\n  █▉▊▋▌▍▎▏  ░▒▓█  ▁▂▃▄▅▆▇█\n\nSparkline:  ▁▂▃▅▂▇▃▆▅▂▄▁▂▅▇▆▃▂▁▄▆\n\nBraille:  ⠁⠉⠙⠹⢸⣰⣤⣆⡇⠏⠛⠟\n\nGeometry:  ● ◐ ◑ ◒ ◓ ○  ◆ ◇  ▲ ▼ ◀ ▶  ★ ☆"
                }
              },
              {
                "size": "49%",
                "pane": {
                  "type": "command",
                  "title": " 256-colour ramp",
                  "border": true,
                  "command": "for r in 16 52 88 124 160 196 202 208 214 220 226; do printf '\\033[48;5;%sm  \\033[0m' $r; done; echo; for r in 16 22 28 34 40 46 47 48 49 50 51; do printf '\\033[48;5;%sm  \\033[0m' $r; done; echo; for r in 16 17 18 19 20 21 27 33 39 45 51; do printf '\\033[48;5;%sm  \\033[0m' $r; done; echo; printf '\\033[38;5;208m●\\033[0m fg  \\033[1;35mbold\\033[0m  \\033[4munderline\\033[0m  \\033[7minverse\\033[0m'"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "size": "58%",
            "children": [
              {
                "size": "45%",
                "pane": {
                  "type": "command",
                  "title": " cowsay + fortune",
                  "border": false,
                  "command": "fortune -s 2>/dev/null | cowsay -W 40 2>/dev/null | lolcat -f -p 2 2>/dev/null || echo 'install fortune/cowsay/lolcat'"
                }
              },
              {
                "size": "*",
                "pane": {
                  "type": "command",
                  "title": " syntax highlight  (bat)",
                  "border": true,
                  "command": "bat --color=always --style=numbers --line-range 1:26 internal/widget/widget.go 2>/dev/null || cat internal/widget/widget.go"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
